## Product

FlowState is a weather-linked financial safety net for gig delivery workers. Its backend predicts workers' expected income using weather conditions and a trained model. When severe weather disrupts earnings, the backend can trigger a fixed emergency payout or offer an eligible worker a small loan.

The backend, ML prediction, decision rules, and local Hardhat payout contract already exist. Your task is to build the frontend only, using Streamlit.

